Turn your body into pure ice, increasing your Cold damage affinity by [5%, 12%, 16%, 19%, 21% (TL1-5)] and your physical resistance by [15%, 20%, 24%, 28%, 31% (TL1-5; SP 100)].

You have a [10%, 23%, 33%, 42%, 50% (TL1-5)] chance to shrug off all direct critical hits (physical, mental, spell).

The effects increase with your Spellpower.
